Finally v2011.11.0 is out. Here is what happened since the last release:

Alexander Shiyan (4):
      Add "imx_get_i2cclk" for MX51
      Add WEIM registers for MX51
      Add 600Mhz freq defines for MX51
      ID fix for mx51 SDHC2

Antony Pavlov (5):
      generate barebox.srec
      ehci-hcd.c: handle EHCI_HAS_TT in ehci_reset() during startup
      fs: fix path_check_prereq()
      fs: fix chdir()
      usb: ehci-hcd.c: fix 'value computed is not used' warning

Fabian van der Werf (1):
      Fixed unaligned access

Franck Jullien (1):
      nios2: remove warnings generated by include/io.h

Hubert Feurstein (8):
      macb: whitespace cleanup
      macb: handle clk_get error
      atmel_mci: handle clk_get error correctly
      spi: add atmel-spi driver
      at91sam9g45: add atmel-spi support
      at91: add spi clock connection id entries
      at91: add missing clkdev changes
      at91sam9260ek: fix broken defconfig

Jan Weitzel (1):
      add option LOCALVERSION to common/Kconfig

Jean-Christophe PLAGNIOL-VILLARD (13):
      arm: export arch_number to env
      at91: fix cpu clock speed display
      at91: Fix uhpck clock rate in upll case
      at91/boards: switch to software ecc as in linux kernel
      resource: introduce add_generic_device_res to add multiple resource
      at91: nand switch ecc base to resource
      usb/core: make print dev like linux lsusb
      at91: add ohci support
      at91: add Calao USB-A960 and USB-A9G20 C01 & C11 board support
      at91: add Calao USB-A9263
      image: use data base addr for image_print_contents, image_multi_count=
/getimg
      image: add multi image support for bootm
      image: move map_image amd unmap_image to image.c

Juergen Beisert (3):
      x86: Define byteorder
      'bootz' command fails to load the zImage's header
      Really fix the 'bootz' command

Juergen Kilb (3):
      Add Reset Support for omap3.
      Add omap_hsmmc platform data.
      Added helper function to get CS1 base address.

Lo=EFc Minier (3):
      Fix spelling of "omitted"; found by lintian
      Only pass -P to cpp when generating ld scripts
      Avoid warnings by using format(__printf__)

Marc Kleine-Budde (7):
      defaultenv: simplify scripting
      defaultenv: boot: add backwards compatibility for kernel_loc=3Dnet
      defaultenv: boot: add eth0 to ip configuration
      defaultenv: boot: add serverip to static ip configuration
      defaultenv: boot: add support to boot from disk
      defaultenv: update: add support to update kernel on disk
      defaultenv: add config template

Paul Fertser (7):
      imx_spi: rework transfer according to the API, fix compatibility with=
 spi_write_then_read()
      imx25: imx_spi: support CSPI v0.7 as found on i.MX25
      mach-imx: iim: clarify documentation
      mach-imx: iim: cosmetic changes to the code to make it easier to foll=
ow
      spi: let master a chance to setup device before registering it
      spi: enfore default bits_per_word value
      spi: indicate in the docs that per-transfer bpw setting is not suppor=
ted

Robert Schwebel (2):
      menu: fix alinment
      mci-core: fix typo for pr_warn

Rosen Kolev (4):
      Modified timeout in the ehci-hcd USB host driver.
      Extended USB device matching.
      USB mass storage device driver initial implementation
      Allow data-only i2c transfers

Sascha Hauer (43):
      usb: honour timeout fields
      initial ohci support
      i.MX NAND: pass second base address as resource
      introduce io.h
      introduce asm-generic/io.h
      arm: use asm-generic/io.h
      drivers/base: fix wrong variable type
      add cpu native ordered io accessors
      cfi flash: use cpu native accessors
      ppc pcm030: remove puts in early init
      cfi flash: fix flash_make_cmd for big endian access
      rename include/mem_malloc.h to include/memory.h
      ARM mmu: find second level descriptors by walking the page table
      introduce generic memory bank handling
      ARM: switch to generic memory banks
      sandbox: make asm/io.h nonempty
      ppc: remove mgt5100 support from code
      ppc: add a get_pc() function
      remove EARLY_INIT and EARLY_CONSOLE support
      ppc mpc5200: add function to determine configured sdram size
      ppc mpc5200: add function to configure a chipselect
      ppc mpc5200: add function to setup bus clocks
      ppc mpc5200b: cleanup lowlevel startup
      pcm030: use new functionality
      ppc: hardcode sdram base to 0x0
      mpc5200: hardcode MBAR to 0xf0000000
      mpc5200: hardcode internal sram for initram
      pcm030: fix /dev/self0 and /dev/env0
      ppc mpc5200: remove bus clock switching from generic code
      pcm030: cleanup config.h
      ppc mpc5200: remove cs setup from cpu_init
      ppc mpc5200: remove various board specific register setup from generi=
c code
      ppc common.h: remove unused function declarations
      net fec_mpc5200: disable fec on shutdown
      Merge branch 'usb-massstorage' into next
      Merge branch 'pu-ppc' into next
      Merge branch 'next'
      mci omap: do not fail on nonexistent pdata
      ARM panda: fix default env path in config
      Merge branch 'pu/omap'
      fix bug introduced with fixing path_check_prereq()
      ARM pcm043: Use external bootmode
      Release v2011.11.0

Thomas Petazzoni (2):
      arm: at91: fix environment location in flash for multiple boards
      arm: at91: Add Atmel NAND support in config for at91sam9m10g45ek

Wolfram Sang (3):
      net: string_to_ip: add sanity check for > 255
      net: getenv_ip: check return value of string_to_ip
      defaultenv: place eth0.ethaddr more visibly

